{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Because it's a 'fairytale' when a fairy tells it!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fate's Theater is a mischievous micro-storyteller where Fortune and Misfortune compete to twist mortal fates into rhyming couplets. Mix and match cards to discover 400+ two-line tales, each with a bright or gleefully gruesome ending depending on which fairy wins. A charming coffee-break companion for dark humor enthusiasts, rhyme lovers, and anyone who enjoys collecting tiny serendipities and pocket-sized catastrophes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>\u201cWhere mortal fates take wicked swings,</i>    <br><i>You choose which fairy pulls the strings!\u201d</i><br>    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> Tiny Tales</strong> \u2014 400+ two-line couplets discovered through card combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twin Endings</strong> \u2014 Each couplet splits between Fortune's joy and Misfortune's wicked doom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cute Meets Macabre</strong> \u2014 Unsuspecting mortals meet new friends... or die horrible deaths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Verse Collection</strong> \u2014 Track discovered verses and unlock new starting cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gentle Strategy</strong> \u2014 Easy rules with a pinch of mind games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shadow Theater</strong> \u2014 Adorable puppet silhouettes with reactive, atmospheric music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or Friend Duels</strong> \u2014 Challenge our theatrical bot or invite a friend</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Honest Indie</strong> \u2014 Polished coffee-break experience at a coffee's price, made with love</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><i>\u201cFortune's kiss, Misfortune's curse,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Who gets to write the final verse?\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2618\ufe0e\ud83d\udc80\u2618\ufe0e\ud83d\udc80\u2618\ufe0e\ud83d\udc80\u2618\ufe0e</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2804100?t=1761938748","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2804100?t=1761938748","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804100/78fe0d3eb600458823c135c390fc18b61cdd07e7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761938748","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804100/78fe0d3eb600458823c135c390fc18b61cdd07e7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761938748","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Features poetic descriptions of violence and gore, served with a dark sense of humor."},"demos":[{"appid":3001040,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Because it's a 'fairytale' when a fairy tells it!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fate's Theater is a mischievous micro-storyteller where Fortune and Misfortune compete to twist mortal fates into rhyming couplets. Mix and match cards to discover 400+ two-line tales, each with a bright or gleefull